[h2]Hello all [b]Punk Wars[/b] fans![/h2]

We are happy to announce that the[b] FREE DLC[/b] for Punk Wars is now available! Initially we planned to release it last week, but during the development we came up with a few new ideas and instead of 2 we created [b]3 new maps[/b] - available in this new gameplay mode only! So we hope this will sweeten the waiting just a little bit :).

[b]PLEASE NOTE: [/b]For Mac users the free DLC will be unlocked tomorrow.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40222679/065dfa81e8882b9cfe914d6350e35c02c17cfdd1.gif[/img]

[b]Punk Wars: Hold the Line[/b] brings you a completely new survival-based game mode where you will have to endure the ever-growing waves of enemies hoping that you can overcome the pressure and finally strike a fatal blow to the enemy forces! Will you survive in the crater, surrounded by waves of enemies? 

[h3]The DLC is 100% FREE! The only requirement is to own the main version of the game.[/h3]

https://store.steampowered.com/app/1830660

Hope you will enjoy this addition during you holiday!

If you want to find out what's coming next, make sure to check out our road map!

Of course we also took this time to introduce some changes and fixes to the game, so here's the [b]full changelog[/b]:

[b]Added:[/b]
[list]
[*] Key binding added;
[*] Added dynamic checking if the next building on the list has actions to be performed.
[/list]
[b]Improvements:[/b]
[list]
[*] Finding paths improvements;
[*] Ai improvements;
[*] Effects display and synchronization improvements;
[*] Opponent's selection resets after return to the menu;
[*] Balance improvements.
[/list]
[b]Fixed bugs:[/b]
[olist]
[*] Fixed time effects;
[*] Fixed bug with actions on dead units;
[*] Fixed a bug with unnecessary animation of the unit action panel;
[*] Fixed bugs with the end of game window;
[*] Fixed a bug with the player's wrong building queue;
[*] Fixed a bug with incorrect removal of invisible unit icons;
[*] Fixed a bug with incorrect path search after destroying an enemy;
[*] Fixed a bug with incorrect display time of particles and action icons for AI;
[*] Fixed a bug with the never ending action "Work" in case of Diesel units;
[*] Fixed a bug with the ability to duplicate building attacks after saving the game;
[*] Fixed "Boil the ocean" motivator action;
[*] Fixed bugs with missing sounds on UI. 
[/olist]
And that's all for today :).

On this occasion we would like to wish you a Merry Christmas and a Happy New Year 2022 (hopefully it will bring an end to the pandemy)! 

[h3]Be punk, stay safe![/h3]

